{"title":"Unclassified Questions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>This is a page created to list questions that come from an unknown source. It could be from a math contest that is not widely known, or from some source that is completely unknown.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"2021_GMC_10B_Problems.2FProblem_19\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"2021_GMC_10B_Problems/Problem_19\">2021 GMC 10B Problems/Problem 19</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Unclassified_Questions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: 2021 GMC 10B Problems/Problem 19\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the remainder when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/8/b88ebb184a067095d876f787a480878b66763d75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{18}-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/4/144fdf024eb8c053b67258019ef0d05a89413456.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$811$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/c/7bc0b852fa9f8b3d0c17f51d0377f74b24b2a2fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textrm{(A) 111}\\qquad\\textrm{(B) 142}\\qquad\\textrm{(C) 157}\\qquad\\textrm{(D) 221}\\qquad\\textrm{(E) 229}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"412\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Unclassified_Questions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><b>Submitted by BinouTheGuineaPig</b> | <i>A step-by-step solution</i>\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/2/4623ed79fc222f0045a88c9a281b6fadc812404b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{18}-1=(3^6\\cdot3^6\\cdot3^6)-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"202\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/7/0a716bed06029716fca2122a56a72bf09618a65b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\qquad\\qquad =(729\\cdot729\\cdot729)-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"241\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/0/0d08d75630852abb1761eb7c26a7a54bc4b8815c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\qquad\\qquad\\equiv (-82\\cdot-82\\cdot-82)-1\\mod811$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"336\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/6/f464d0cbe761777111250c907620fc2c67b40106.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\qquad\\qquad\\equiv -(2^3)(41^3)-1\\mod811$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"284\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/a/d4a3256e0d4559194eb9495960dbc4f2c347e0f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\qquad\\qquad\\equiv -(8)(41)(41^2)-1\\mod811$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"309\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/5/0e50222e07cb276b62ff4ae99270b247479397ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\qquad\\qquad\\equiv -(328)(1681)-1\\mod811$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"305\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/5/535bbbc3f1af1148d87441b2540ba4a590af6e08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\qquad\\qquad\\equiv -(-483)(59)-1\\mod811$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"301\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/c/c5cba70b5fb41c06c0d484e1fe4c24b9a9bb4c2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\qquad\\qquad\\equiv 28496\\mod811$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"213\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/7/5b7c600bdddf019460442fdb4afc0463d15c0fa4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\qquad\\qquad\\equiv 111\\mod811$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"195\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Unclassified_Questions&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018112846\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 54/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 307/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2502/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.198      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.198      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:24155:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018112846 and revision id 262104. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}